title: Dell PowerVault ME5: Temperature Sensors
agents: dell_powervault_me5
catalog: hw/storagehw/dell
license: GPLv2
distribution: Sher Zaman
description:
 Monitors the temperature sensors of a Dell PowerVault ME5 system, covering the
 controllers, the I/O modules, the capacitor packs and the power supplies.

 The service state follows the array's own verdict for each sensor, because the
 array applies the correct limit per sensor type and location. The reading is
 recorded as a metric for trending. Numeric warning and critical levels remain
 available through the built-in Checkmk "Temperature" ruleset, which also
 controls whether device state or user levels take precedence.

item:
 The sensor name as reported by the array (for example
 {"CPU Temperature-Ctlr A"}). Sensors in expansion enclosures have the
 enclosure appended.

discovery:
 One service is created per temperature sensor that reports a reading.
